Subject: [PATCH 819/913] dt-bindings: regulator: add support of vrefbuf on
 STM32MP13 and STM32MP25

Add support of regulator vrefbuf on STM32MP13 with compatible
"st,stm32mp13-vrefbuf" and on STM32MP25 with compatible
"st,stm32mp25-vrefbuf".

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 660cca5eae1f96eb5aabc4f828d2d901e54b3b3c dt-bindings: regulator: add support of vrefbuf on STM32MP13 and STM32MP25]
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: If5ab20989aefded1ab59ad7b931fbd02219fb9e3
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/584302
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/regulator/st,stm32-vrefbuf.yaml      | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/st,stm32-vrefbuf.yaml b/documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/st,stm32-vrefbuf.yaml
index 6ceaffb45..dec958fce 100644
--- a/documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/st,stm32-vrefbuf.yaml
+++ b/documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/st,stm32-vrefbuf.yaml
@@ -19,7 +19,10 @@ allOf:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: st,stm32-vrefbuf
+    enum:
+      - st,stm32-vrefbuf
+      - st,stm32mp13-vrefbuf
+      - st,stm32mp25-vrefbuf
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
